When entering the app, the '''Intro Cutscene''' of the last-entered area will show up on-screen over a background of flames and silhouetted Cats. Tapping and holding the screen will speed up the text scroll, but it can also be skipped with the button in the bottom right.
{{Clear}}

==December 31st==
[[File:True Superfeline intro.jpg|300px|right]]
From [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]] onward, playing on December 31st changes the game's intro to an [https://youtu.be/SkSqWL-u7Vg alternate version] in which [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|True Superfeline]] steadily approaches the player. At the end of the intro, the screen turns red, alluding to the line, "{{CURRENTYEAR}}, New Year's Eve. The Japanese archipelago is stained with blood," ({{CURRENTYEAR}}年、大晦日。日本列島が血に染まる) in the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese Version]]'s intro.

