==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]], the intro would always show [[Empire of Cats]]' intro, could not be sped up by tapping and holding, and would not display while downloading data.
*If the last-entered area was [[Legend Stages]], the intro cutscene will always show Stories of Legend's intro, even if Uncanny Legends or Zero Legends are unlocked.
*If the last-entered area was the [[Catclaw Dojo]] or [[Underground Labyrinth]], the intro cutscene will show Empire of Cats' intro.
*The silhouettes of the Cats in the intro bear a striking resemblance to the [[Killer Cat (Rare Cat)|Killer Cats]], even down to the red eyes.
**This connection is further reinforced by the fact that [[Horde of Cats]]' Event Banners are designed similarly to the fiery background used in the intro cutscene.
*Unlike most other date-specific events, True Superfeline in the intro can be seen by changing the device's date.

